Security points
  The Web API respects table permissions and column permission profiles, so a visitor can only touch rows
  and columns they are granted. List only needed columns in the fields setting.
  Anonymous access requires permissions on the Anonymous Users role. Grant read-only at most and only for public data.
  Rate limiting applies per user. Avoid loops of single calls: fetch sets with one query.

